{"id":"5d4eae4b8b30ad03","group":"92","path":"92/92-lem-rule-representable.md","title":"Inference Rules Representable","display":"lem-rule-representable — Inference Rules Representable","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-lem-rule-representable","aliases":["92-lem-rule-representable"],"display":"lem-rule-representable — Inference Rules Representable","depends_on":["[[92-df-representable]]","[[92-ax-modus-ponens]]","[[92-ax-generalization]]","[[92-df-godel-numbering]]","[[92-df-godel-pairing]]","[[92-df-robinson-arithmetic]]","[[92-df-g-system]]","[[92-df-axiom-set]]","[[92-thm-representability]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-lem-rule-representable"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-lem-rule-representable</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-rule-representable — Inference Rules Representable"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d9d845f6cd765d21\" href=\"?note=d9d845f6cd765d21\" title=\"92-df-representable\">92-df-representable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"16613851c4bce386\" href=\"?note=16613851c4bce386\" title=\"92-ax-modus-ponens\">92-ax-modus-ponens</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"906680bfce5f44c0\" href=\"?note=906680bfce5f44c0\" title=\"92-ax-generalization\">92-ax-generalization</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"2413c1d0ca8a0ce6\" href=\"?note=2413c1d0ca8a0ce6\" title=\"92-df-godel-numbering\">92-df-godel-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"20fe67463d98fb92\" href=\"?note=20fe67463d98fb92\" title=\"92-df-godel-pairing\">92-df-godel-pairing</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"468d35690d25ee42\" href=\"?note=468d35690d25ee42\" title=\"92-df-robinson-arithmetic\">92-df-robinson-arithmetic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"e0eabee5d77258a7\" href=\"?note=e0eabee5d77258a7\" title=\"92-df-g-system\">92-df-g-system</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"35c764f4e9f21f28\" href=\"?note=35c764f4e9f21f28\" title=\"92-df-axiom-set\">92-df-axiom-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"0b2170bf5b3075ce\" href=\"?note=0b2170bf5b3075ce\" title=\"92-thm-representability\">92-thm-representability</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MP}, \\mathrm{Gen}\">\\(\\mathrm{MP}, \\mathrm{Gen}\\)</span> (modus ponens, generalization)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J\">\\(J\\)</span> (pairing encoder, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"20fe67463d98fb92\" href=\"?note=20fe67463d98fb92\" title=\"92-df-godel-pairing\">92-df-godel-pairing</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R_{\\mathrm{MP}},R_{\\mathrm{Gen}}\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(R_{\\mathrm{MP}},R_{\\mathrm{Gen}}\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span> (encoded rule-relation sets)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ax}(G)\">\\(Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ax}(G)\\)</span> (arithmetic-strength assumption, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"468d35690d25ee42\" href=\"?note=468d35690d25ee42\" title=\"92-df-robinson-arithmetic\">92-df-robinson-arithmetic</a> and <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"35c764f4e9f21f28\" href=\"?note=35c764f4e9f21f28\" title=\"92-df-axiom-set\">92-df-axiom-set</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Rep}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Rep}_G\\)</span> (representability predicate in <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"d9d845f6cd765d21\" href=\"?note=d9d845f6cd765d21\" title=\"92-df-representable\">92-df-representable</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}rule\\text{-}representable}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\nR_{\\mathrm{MP}}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{J(\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner,J(\\ulcorner\\varphi\\to\\psi\\urcorner,\\ulcorner\\psi\\urcorner))\\mid\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\},\\\\\nR_{\\mathrm{Gen}}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{J(\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner,\\ulcorner\\forall x\\,\\varphi\\urcorner)\\mid\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G,\\ x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_G\\},\\\\\nQ\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ax}(G)&amp;\\Longrightarrow\\bigl(\\mathrm{Rep}_G(R_{\\mathrm{MP}})\\land\\mathrm{Rep}_G(R_{\\mathrm{Gen}})\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}rule\\text{-}representable}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\nR_{\\mathrm{MP}}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{J(\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner,J(\\ulcorner\\varphi\\to\\psi\\urcorner,\\ulcorner\\psi\\urcorner))\\mid\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\},\\\\\nR_{\\mathrm{Gen}}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{J(\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner,\\ulcorner\\forall x\\,\\varphi\\urcorner)\\mid\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G,\\ x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_G\\},\\\\\nQ\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ax}(G)&amp;\\Longrightarrow\\bigl(\\mathrm{Rep}_G(R_{\\mathrm{MP}})\\land\\mathrm{Rep}_G(R_{\\mathrm{Gen}})\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Rep}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Rep}_G\\)</span>作用于自然数集合，因此先把多元规则关系用<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J\">\\(J\\)</span>编码为一元集合</li>\n<li>推理规则可表示是初等系统的条件</li>\n<li>MP关系：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(m, n, k)\">\\((m, n, k)\\)</span>满足<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span>是从<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m, n\">\\(m, n\\)</span>通过MP得到</li>\n<li>Gen关系：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(m, k)\">\\((m, k)\\)</span>满足<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span>是从<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\">\\(m\\)</span>通过Gen得到</li>\n<li>在固定有效语法编码下，这些编码关系是原始递归可判定的；先得到递归集，再由<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"0b2170bf5b3075ce\" href=\"?note=0b2170bf5b3075ce\" title=\"92-thm-representability\">92-thm-representability</a>在公理集包含<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\">\\(Q\\)</span>的系统中表示</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-representable","status":"resolved","id":"d9d845f6cd765d21","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-representable]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-ax-modus-ponens","status":"resolved","id":"16613851c4bce386","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-ax-modus-ponens]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-ax-generalization","status":"resolved","id":"906680bfce5f44c0","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-ax-generalization]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-godel-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"2413c1d0ca8a0ce6","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-godel-numbering]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-godel-pairing","status":"resolved","id":"20fe67463d98fb92","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-godel-pairing]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-robinson-arithmetic","status":"resolved","id":"468d35690d25ee42","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-robinson-arithmetic]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-g-system","status":"resolved","id":"e0eabee5d77258a7","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-g-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-axiom-set","status":"resolved","id":"35c764f4e9f21f28","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-axiom-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-thm-representability","status":"resolved","id":"0b2170bf5b3075ce","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-thm-representability]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-godel-pairing","status":"resolved","id":"20fe67463d98fb92","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$J$ (pairing encoder, see [[92-df-godel-pairing]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-robinson-arithmetic","status":"resolved","id":"468d35690d25ee42","anchor":"ref-11","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ax}(G)$ (arithmetic-strength assumption, see [[92-df-robinson-arithmetic]] and [[92-df-axiom-set]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-axiom-set","status":"resolved","id":"35c764f4e9f21f28","anchor":"ref-12","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ax}(G)$ (arithmetic-strength assumption, see [[92-df-robinson-arithmetic]] and [[92-df-axiom-set]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-representable","status":"resolved","id":"d9d845f6cd765d21","anchor":"ref-13","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Rep}_G$ (representability predicate in $G$, see [[92-df-representable]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-thm-representability","status":"resolved","id":"0b2170bf5b3075ce","anchor":"ref-14","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"在固定有效语法编码下，这些编码关系是原始递归可判定的；先得到递归集，再由[[92-thm-representability]]在公理集包含$Q$的系统中表示","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{MP}, \\mathrm{Gen}","display":false},{"tex":"J","display":false